{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "TriMet Park and Rides by capacity",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Scales each mark by SPACES and ramps its color with it, over a range that runs from small lots up to the 750-space Clackamas Town Center garage. Area, not radius, tracks capacity, so a lot that looks twice as big holds roughly twice as many cars. The whole system holds 12,501 spaces."
  },
